PDFCube 0.1.0 (2026-10-11)
==========================

- Ported the application from GtkGLExt to GTK 4 GtkGLArea.
- Replaced fixed-function OpenGL with a shader-based OpenGL 3.3 renderer.
- Split command-line parsing, PDF loading, application state, and rendering
  into focused C++20 modules.
- Preserved cube and plain transitions, programmed timing, zoom regions,
  fullscreen and demo modes, keyboard navigation, and configuration files.
- Added Meson, deterministic CLI and rendering tests, sanitizer CI, modern
  desktop/AppStream metadata, and updated Debian packaging.
- Removed the obsolete Autotools and GtkGLExt implementation.
